    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2L9jaPX9SwPN4TvirmLfDc9)_\n\n## What\n`sp-vulpea-base` ran `(vulpea-db-query-by-tags-every '(\"project\" \"active\"))` at load time. Its result was discarded, and `vulpea` is only autoloaded for `vulpea-find`, so the function was void: `sp-org-ext` failed with `(void-function vulpea-db-query-by-tags-every)`, and `sp-tab-inbox` (which requires `vulpea-ui`) failed after it.\n\n- Removed the line from `sp-vulpea-base.el` and the \"Sample query\" section from `sp-vulpea.org`.\n- Added the #141 line to the doc's \"Changes by pull request\" and to CHANGELOG.org (Open pull requests).\n\n## Not tested\nNothing was run in Emacs (none in the container). Please restart and check `*Messages*` for `sp-org-ext` / `sp-tab-inbox`, and `(featurep 'vulpea-ui)`.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiBbmfhRQvmwUR1fT6S)_",
